The IT industry is rapidly evolving with trends like Agentic AI, Edge Computing, and Quantum-Safe Cryptography, focusing on autonomous systems, decentralized processing, and enhanced security. Key areas include AI-driven automation (GenAI, Multiagent Systems), advanced connectivity (5G/6G), immersive tech (AR/VR/Spatial Computing), Hyperautomation, and AI Governance for responsible AI, with significant growth in sustainable tech and AI-native development tools
